# Donor outreach email. Fill in SMTP_HOST and SMTP_USERNAME/SMTP_PASSWORD,
# then restart the API. Leave SMTP_HOST empty to keep campaigns simulated.
# Port 587 uses STARTTLS; for port 465 set SMTP_USE_TLS=false and SMTP_USE_SSL=true.
